        {
          "id": 2506763101,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I guess one question is whether GQUIC wants to set `COL_PROTOCOL` to `HTTP2` in that case anyway. It didn't for a number of years (before f43ce70fd9cc11a74f6ed942d9ba4edddfe8d9dd). If it wants to set the Protocol column, it could do it itself.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
